{% comment %}
  Belle's Performance Tennis - Pricing Explainers

  Split out of belle-pricing-section on 2026-08-23 so these blocks render
  BELOW the detailed pricing table and the add-ons list. Shopify sections
  are atomic, so they could not stay inside the pricing section and still
  appear after add-ons.

  Page order (templates/page.pricing.json):
    1. belle-pricing-section     hero, turnaround tiers, detailed table
    2. belles-pricing-addons     add-on price list
    3. belle-pricing-explainers  THIS FILE
    4. belle-faq-section
    5. cta-inline

  Intent: the pricing page leads with numbers and puts the reasoning
  underneath. Do not move these blocks back above the tables.

  Blocks: Not sure what string, What You're Paying For (with stringer
  callout), What happens to your racquet.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .bp-explain {
    --bp-green: #1a3c2a;
    --bp-gold: #c8a951;
    --bp-border: #e5e5e5;
    --bp-text: #1a1a1a;
    --bp-muted: #666;
    --bp-bg: #faf9f6;
    --bp-white: #ffffff;
    --bp-light-green: #f4f8f5;
    font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;
    padding: 0 20px 40px;
    background: var(--bp-bg);
  }

  .bp-explain .bp-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── 3. NOT SURE? ── */
  .bp-not-sure {
    background: var(--bp-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--bp-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .bp-not-sure h2 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--bp-green);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .bp-not-sure-intro {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--bp-muted);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .bp-not-sure-list {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--bp-text);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    padding-left: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .bp-not-sure-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .bp-not-sure-list li svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--bp-green);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  .bp-not-sure-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--bp-muted);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    padding-left: 22px;
  }

  .bp-not-sure-sub span {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--bp-light-green);
    color: var(--bp-green);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin: 3px 3px 0 0;
  }

  .bp-not-sure-close {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--bp-text);
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ── 5. WHAT YOU GET / WHY BELLE'S ── */
  .bp-why {
    background: var(--bp-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--bp-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .bp-why h2 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--bp-green);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .bp-why-intro {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--bp-muted);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .bp-why-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .bp-why-list li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--bp-text);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .bp-why-list li svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--bp-green);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  /* Stringer callout — elevated personal statement */
  .bp-stringer-callout {
    background: var(--bp-green);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }

  .bp-stringer-callout p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bp-stringer-callout p strong {
    color: var(--bp-gold);
    display: block;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  /* ── 7. WHAT HAPPENS ── */
  .bp-includes {
    background: var(--bp-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--bp-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .bp-includes h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--bp-text);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }

  .bp-includes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 8px 20px;
  }

  .bp-includes-item {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--bp-muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .bp-includes-item svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--bp-green);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
  .bp-includes-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="bp-explain">
  <div class="bp-container">

    <!-- 1. NOT SURE WHAT STRING? -->
    <div class="bp-not-sure">
      <h2>Not Sure What String You Need?</h2>
      <p class="bp-not-sure-intro">Most customers aren&rsquo;t sure, and that&rsquo;s normal.</p>
      <ul class="bp-not-sure-list">
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          What you use now
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          How often you play
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          What you want more of
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="bp-not-sure-sub">
        <span>Power</span>
        <span>Control</span>
        <span>Comfort</span>
        <span>Spin</span>
      </p>
      <p class="bp-not-sure-close">Bring your racquet. I&rsquo;ll help you choose a setup.</p>
    </div>


    <!-- 2. WHAT YOU'RE PAYING FOR -->
    <div class="bp-why">
      <h2>What You&rsquo;re Paying For</h2>
      <p class="bp-why-intro">You&rsquo;re not paying for just strings. You&rsquo;re paying for:</p>
      <ul class="bp-why-list">
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          Every racquet strung by the same person, so the job is the same every time
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          Direct communication with the stringer, from drop-off to pickup
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          A Gamma Progression II electronic constant-pull machine that holds tension steady through the whole job
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          A finished string bed measured with an ERT 300 dynamic tension meter, so the tension you asked for is the tension you got
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          No membership and no club fees
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          No shipping your racquet across the country and waiting a week
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bp-stringer-callout">
        <p>
          <strong>I string every racquet myself.</strong>The person you email, the person you meet at drop-off, and the
          person who strings your racquet are the same person.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- 3. WHAT HAPPENS TO YOUR RACQUET -->
    <div class="bp-includes">
      <h3>What happens to your racquet</h3>
      <div class="bp-includes-grid">
        <div class="bp-includes-item">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          Old strings removed and discarded
        </div>
        <div class="bp-includes-item">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          Frame inspected before stringing starts
        </div>
        <div class="bp-includes-item">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          New strings installed at your requested tension
        </div>
        <div class="bp-includes-item">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          String bed straightened and checked
        </div>
        <div class="bp-includes-item">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          String type and tension labeled on frame
        </div>
        <div class="bp-includes-item">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          Setup logged, I remember your specs next time
        </div>
        <div class="bp-includes-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
          </svg>
          Borrow a Solinco demo racquet, free, while yours is being strung
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

